    <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CARTETHYIA_UI_HELP_SWITCH"><Text>Change between Wisdom and Power. Uses all remaining movement and ends Cartethyia's actions this turn. Preserves health, experience, promotions and both skill cooldowns.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CARTETHYIA_UI_HELP_WISDOM"><Text>In Wisdom form, immediately complete the current finite production item in your city. Completes one item without bonus overflow. Uses all remaining movement. Standard-speed cooldown: 20 turns, adjusted for game speed.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CARTETHYIA_UI_HELP_POWER"><Text>In Power form, choose one of six directions. Strike visible enemy military units in the next three tiles for 70%, 60% and 50% of maximum health. Does not damage cities, civilians, aircraft, friendly or neutral units. Uses all remaining movement and counts as an attack. Cooldown: 5 turns.</Text></Row>
